Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(contact): prefill WhatsApp messages on contact,
 footer and chat links

The WhatsApp buttons in the homepage contact block, the footer 24/7
emergency block, the AI chat widget footer and the /links page opened a
blank WhatsApp chat, leaving the visitor to type an opening message.
Add a ?text= prefill so the enquiry arrives with context.

- web/site/home.html contact block: "Hello, I am interested in NEAS services."
- web/site/home.html footer emergency block: "Hello NEAS, this is an urgent enquiry."
- web/components/ChatBot.tsx and web/app/links/page.tsx: general prefill

The wa.me/?text= links in the service and store share widgets are left
untouched: they are share buttons alongside Facebook/Messenger/X/LinkedIn
and are meant to open a recipient picker, not a chat with NEAS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013E71HHNBrVB7D4V6VgonLA
